A '''Hewver''' is a {{Mt|Critter}} that can be spawned by applying Honey to [[Fig Tree]]s on the {{Zone|Moonglade Marsh}}.

== Spawning ==
A '''Hewver''' has a {{Chance|16.{{Overline|6}}%|1|6}} chance to spawn after applying a {{Item|Fun-Sized Pot of Honeycomb|text=Fun-Sized}}, {{Item|Family-Sized Pot of Honeycomb|text=Family-Sized}}, {{Item|Jumbo Pot of Honeycomb|text=Jumbo}}, or {{Item|Behemoth Pot of Honeycomb}} to a [[Fig Tree]] with a [[Tree Protection Order]].

== Behavior ==
A '''Hewver''' walks around on the ground by default while sucking in nearby mobs. If the player throws a [[Lasso]] at it, it begins to move towards them. If the '''Hewver''' touches the player, it breaks the [[Lasso]] and sends the following message:
{{Dialogue|&f&oThe strength of the &9&oHewver's &f&osnout broke your &b&oLasso&f&o!}}

Reeling in the '''Hewver''' captures it.

